                <invention-title lang="de">END-TO-END-WASSERZEICHENSYSTEM</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME DE FILIGRANAGE DE BOUT EN BOUT</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">END-TO-END WATERMARKING SYSTEM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Methods, systems, and apparatus, including computer programs encoded on a computer storage medium, for jointly training an encoder that generates a watermark and a decoder that decodes a data item encoded within the watermark. The training comprises obtaining a plurality of training images and data items. For each training image, a first watermark is generated using an encoder and a subsequent second watermark is generated by tiling two or more first watermarks. The training image is watermarked using the second watermark to generate a first error value and distortions are added to the watermarked image. A distortion detector predicts the distortions based on which the distorted image is modified. The modified image is decoded by the decoder to generate a predicted data item and a second error value. The training parameters of the encoder and decoder are adjusted based on the first and the second error value.</p>
            </abstract>
